    "extern send records the peer's sighting in the machine-wide extern-peers.json before it validates the body, the org or the attachments (same docket)",
    "the external-chat MCP server sends no credential, so every externtool verb is refused 401 by the TokenGate of both current launch paths (reported to the coordinator by the P01 F4 item)"
